<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cifra upgraded to buy. [corrected 15:45 gmt]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cifra upgraded to buy. [corrected 15:45 gmt]</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JP Morgan raised its rating on Mexican retailer Cifra to buy from market performer, the brokerage said in a statement Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We believe that Cifra is well positioned in 1997 for improved growth in earnings and profitability,&quot; analysts Debra Wang and Richard Long wrote. (Corrects names of analysts).</p>
</text>
